<div class="a-text font-text text-base normal mt-8 first:mt-0 space-y-4">
    <p style="text-align: justify;">Any access gate shall meet the requirements of the adjacent guard-rails, except for the toe plate which is not required. Self-closing gates shall be held in position without being locked, designed to open easily onto the platform or floor and close against a firm stop to prevent accidental falls.<br />&nbsp;</p>
